The [[Shepherd's Crook]] is an item obtained by combining the [[Broom]] and [[Whetstone]], which are both common items available in the shop for all characters. It gives all [[weapon|weapons]] in its "crook" +2 damage, up to five of them. It also protects buffs from removal and gives a very high chance to resist {{icon/blind}} and {{icon/cold}}. It's a large item and takes up a lot of space, but it costs no stamina to use. Its passive effects are also fairly respectable, and can make a big difference in the right match-up. 

The effects of the Crook stack additively, having two will give the player 100% {{icon/blind}} and {{icon/cold}} resist, and three would grant 100% chance to protect buffs from removal.
